  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759232,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1007 Bolts: A NES Synopsis\n\nTrapped in a perilous world, you've incurred the wrath of the Gods! Your only hope for survival is to outwit their divine fury in *1007 Bolts* for the Nintendo Entertainment System. This frantic, single-screen action game tasks you with simply enduring until the next sunrise. \n\nMovement is restricted to left and right, forcing you to dodge bolts of lightning that strike repeatedly – a constant, unpredictable threat. The catch? You possess the power to briefly halt time using the Start button, offering precious moments to strategize and evade. \n\nBut beware! The longer you survive, the more enraged the Gods become, escalating the challenge. *1007 Bolts* is a test of reflexes and timing, demanding quick thinking and precise movements. Can you appease the Gods and live to see another day, or will you become another victim of their divine punishment? A simple premise, but a surprisingly addictive and challenging experience awaits!"
    },
